{
    "title": "Crazy Office \u2014 Slap & Smash",
    "description": "Dive into the world of casual games to loosen up! \ud83c\udfae Step into a crazy office where you can kick, smash, and slap your way through the workday chaos, unleashing your inner brawler! \ud83e\udd4a\ud83e\udd29\r\n\r\nIt's another day at the office, and your boss is making you work overtime again. What a jerk! \ud83d\udcbc It's time to square your accounts and become crazy! But before you whack your boss in real life, try Crazy Office\u2014the smash-hit office game. Take out all your workday frustrations with the help of our exciting casual games! \ud83c\udfe2\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f\r\n\r\nToday, your office is your wreck room, so let all your rage out. \ud83d\udd28 Turn off your brain and start wreaking havoc: fight your colleagues, kick your buddies, throw people, and smash it all to unleash complete anarchy on the entire office floor. Turn your anger into relaxation as you fight through the bootlicking white collars, pesky managers, and stupid security guards. \ud83d\udcbc\r\n\r\nTry to destroy the entire office to get to your final target\u2014the CEO. All your life you wanted to beat the boss, and now you finally can get your sweet revenge! \ud83e\udd4a From office supplies to golf clubs\u2014there is an arsenal of weapons to smack your boss with. Have fun while you kick your buddies and beat the boss in this satisfying slap game! \ud83e\udd29\r\n\r\nPlenty of slapping games and hitting games will let you vent, but none quite like this crazy kick simulator! This smash-hit game is surely the healthiest way of dealing with office stress and rage, short of yoga classes or breathing exercises. \ud83c\udfe2\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f\r\n\r\nYou think you\u2019ve seen enough crazy games, huh? This office game will prove to be crazier than all the other work games you\u2019ve ever played. \ud83e\udd29\ud83c\udfae\r\n\r\nCasual Game Features:\r\n\ud83c\udfe2 Realistic Office Space: In the world of our crazygames, you\u2019ll feel the pulse of a simple office life: coffee machines as hubs for gossip, busy conference rooms filled with brainstorming sessions, and cubicles lined with papers and laptops.\r\n\ud83e\udd4aFun Boxing Battle: Work on a powerful punch or slap to beat and get into epic boxing mode against yet another office jerk to prove you're the ultimate office champion! This wreck room simulator has no limits\u2014destroy the office rooms and fight your annoying coworkers!\r\n\ud83c\udfae Work Games with a Twist: This isn't your typical office day! Experience unique work games that combine the well-known mechanics of slapping games with the fun and anti-stress effect of the wreck room experience!\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Countless Office Maps: Punch and throw people in a battle that takes place in various office settings! And be careful to not get lost in the room maze during your hitting games! Created by Freeplay LLC, this game brings you the ultimate office brawl experience!\r\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Unlimited Arsenal of Weapons: Smack your colleagues and beat the boss using not only your crazy kick power but whatever object you can find, champion! Break chairs and desks, and smash it all during your crazygames to loosen up.\r\n\r\nCrazy Office is the casual game by Freeplay LLC that you've all been waiting for! It\u2019s nothing like the innocent work games or casual games you might have played before. Download this exciting slap game now and show \u2018em who's crazy! \r\n\r\nAre you ready to vent all your frustrations in the office space and turn it into a real wreck room? Then dive into the world of crazy games with Crazy Office and live this day to the fullest! \ud83c\udfae\ud83c\udfe2\ud83e\udd29",
    "descriptionHTML": "Dive into the world of casual games to loosen up! \ud83c\udfae Step into a crazy office where you can kick, smash, and slap your way through the workday chaos, unleashing your inner brawler! \ud83e\udd4a\ud83e\udd29<br><br>It&#39;s another day at the office, and your boss is making you work overtime again. What a jerk! \ud83d\udcbc It&#39;s time to square your accounts and become crazy! But before you whack your boss in real life, try Crazy Office\u2014the smash-hit office game. Take out all your workday frustrations with the help of our exciting casual games! \ud83c\udfe2\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f<br><br>Today, your office is your wreck room, so let all your rage out. \ud83d\udd28 Turn off your brain and start wreaking havoc: fight your colleagues, kick your buddies, throw people, and smash it all to unleash complete anarchy on the entire office floor. Turn your anger into relaxation as you fight through the bootlicking white collars, pesky managers, and stupid security guards. \ud83d\udcbc<br><br>Try to destroy the entire office to get to your final target\u2014the CEO. All your life you wanted to beat the boss, and now you finally can get your sweet revenge! \ud83e\udd4a From office supplies to golf clubs\u2014there is an arsenal of weapons to smack your boss with. Have fun while you kick your buddies and beat the boss in this satisfying slap game! \ud83e\udd29<br><br>Plenty of slapping games and hitting games will let you vent, but none quite like this crazy kick simulator! This smash-hit game is surely the healthiest way of dealing with office stress and rage, short of yoga classes or breathing exercises. \ud83c\udfe2\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f<br><br>You think you\u2019ve seen enough crazy games, huh? This office game will prove to be crazier than all the other work games you\u2019ve ever played. \ud83e\udd29\ud83c\udfae<br><br>Casual Game Features:<br>\ud83c\udfe2 Realistic Office Space: In the world of our crazygames, you\u2019ll feel the pulse of a simple office life: coffee machines as hubs for gossip, busy conference rooms filled with brainstorming sessions, and cubicles lined with papers and laptops.<br>\ud83e\udd4aFun Boxing Battle: Work on a powerful punch or slap to beat and get into epic boxing mode against yet another office jerk to prove you&#39;re the ultimate office champion! This wreck room simulator has no limits\u2014destroy the office rooms and fight your annoying coworkers!<br>\ud83c\udfae Work Games with a Twist: This isn&#39;t your typical office day! Experience unique work games that combine the well-known mechanics of slapping games with the fun and anti-stress effect of the wreck room experience!<br>\ud83d\udca5 Countless Office Maps: Punch and throw people in a battle that takes place in various office settings! And be careful to not get lost in the room maze during your hitting games! Created by Freeplay LLC, this game brings you the ultimate office brawl experience!<br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Unlimited Arsenal of Weapons: Smack your colleagues and beat the boss using not only your crazy kick power but whatever object you can find, champion! Break chairs and desks, and smash it all during your crazygames to loosen up.<br><br>Crazy Office is the casual game by Freeplay LLC that you&#39;ve all been waiting for! It\u2019s nothing like the innocent work games or casual games you might have played before. Download this exciting slap game now and show \u2018em who&#39;s crazy! <br><br>Are you ready to vent all your frustrations in the office space and turn it into a real wreck room? Then dive into the world of crazy games with Crazy Office and live this day to the fullest! \ud83c\udfae\ud83c\udfe2\ud83e\udd29",
